  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A light source of power P is observed from a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>. The power of the source is then halved.</p>\n<p>At what distance from the source will the intensity be the same as before?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{8}\"></span></li></ol>"
